 3, the index of 7"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The vertices live in flat arrays with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int32"},{"type":"text","text":" links, so the tree holds fewer than 2³¹ − 1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements, and copying it copies a few arrays only when one copy is mutated."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/init()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/init(_:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/height"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/color(of:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/elements(in:)-37c2j","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/elements(in:)-6yum3","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/lowerBound(_:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/max()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/min()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/remove(at:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/remove(checkedAt:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/upperBound(_:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Subscripts","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/subscript(checked:)"],"anchor":"Subscripts"},